{"4067370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Prospice: Anomalous Logistics", "steam_appid": 4067370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond broken trails and untamed terrain lies a place where the world itself unravels - an island cursed by the corpses of ever rotting gods. Uncover the story of humankind's ancestry on your expedition for occult knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/6bf0890be062c87037ab03bbe67b9744.poster.avif?t=1785774608\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/6bf0890be062c87037ab03bbe67b9744.webm?t=1785774608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/6bf0890be062c87037ab03bbe67b9744.mp4?t=1785774608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a driver, plotting river crossings and navigating bogs and rocky slopes to push exploration further and deeper. You are also a pathfinder, a witness, a courier of forgotten truths, and a trespasser in a place where remnants of humanity’s original sin still fester. You carry more than supplies: survival, knowledge, and perhaps the key to awakening something that should remain buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/b064395c729d568fe0f47d4025b15e48.poster.avif?t=1785774608\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/b064395c729d568fe0f47d4025b15e48.webm?t=1785774608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/b064395c729d568fe0f47d4025b15e48.mp4?t=1785774608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Logistics</strong> - Plan routes, manage fuel, and complete deliveries across treacherous terrain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts &amp; Cargo</strong> - Keep outposts running and transport unique finds, each a fragment of humanity’s forgotten hunt for the divine prey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On-Foot Exploration</strong> - Leave the safety of your truck to interact with your environment and uncover ancient secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Open World</strong> - Explore a vast, uncharted land from its coastline to the heart of the island, warped by dreams of god-husks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade for the Unknown</strong> - Upgrade and adapt your vehicle to survive deeper incursions into corrupted lands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Document the Uncanny</strong> - Use specialized tools to identify, recover, and record artifacts born of godly decay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond broken trails and untamed terrain lies a place where the world itself unravels - an island cursed by the corpses of ever rotting gods. Uncover the story of humankind's ancestry on your expedition for occult knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/6bf0890be062c87037ab03bbe67b9744.poster.avif?t=1785774608\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/6bf0890be062c87037ab03bbe67b9744.webm?t=1785774608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/6bf0890be062c87037ab03bbe67b9744.mp4?t=1785774608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a driver, plotting river crossings and navigating bogs and rocky slopes to push exploration further and deeper. You are also a pathfinder, a witness, a courier of forgotten truths, and a trespasser in a place where remnants of humanity’s original sin still fester. You carry more than supplies: survival, knowledge, and perhaps the key to awakening something that should remain buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/b064395c729d568fe0f47d4025b15e48.poster.avif?t=1785774608\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/b064395c729d568fe0f47d4025b15e48.webm?t=1785774608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/extras/b064395c729d568fe0f47d4025b15e48.mp4?t=1785774608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Logistics</strong> - Plan routes, manage fuel, and complete deliveries across treacherous terrain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts &amp; Cargo</strong> - Keep outposts running and transport unique finds, each a fragment of humanity’s forgotten hunt for the divine prey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On-Foot Exploration</strong> - Leave the safety of your truck to interact with your environment and uncover ancient secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Open World</strong> - Explore a vast, uncharted land from its coastline to the heart of the island, warped by dreams of god-husks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade for the Unknown</strong> - Upgrade and adapt your vehicle to survive deeper incursions into corrupted lands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Document the Uncanny</strong> - Use specialized tools to identify, recover, and record artifacts born of godly decay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Haul cursed cargo across a haunted island, where the terrain can take your life and every road bears the scars of the past.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/67c7f778d444eb51f8b33ed641d4cdd6161a850b/header.jpg?t=1785774608", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/e2deaee5db8d1e7cd9faeb18381f0437b1bb4c72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785774608", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067370/e2deaee5db8d1e7cd9faeb18381f0437b1bb4c72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785774608", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 60+ fps target</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700K / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br><